                <pb facs="0446" n="1180" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1180"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Taylor.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-03-25"><hi rendition="#italic">March 25,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Inform minister foreign affairs that President appreciates his generous
                    assurances and the great responsibilities he has suddenly assumed, and does not
                    permit himself to doubt that <hi rendition="#italic">Alliança</hi> incident will
                    be satisfactorily adjusted in due time without disturbance of the friendly
                    relations between the two Governments.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gresham.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
